{
  "id": "remove_duplicates_from_sorted_list",
  "title": "Remove Duplicates from Sorted List",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "category": "Algorithms",
  "tags": [
    "Linked List"
  ],
  "description": "<p>Given the <code>head</code> of a sorted linked list, <em>delete all duplicates such that each element appears only once</em>. Return <em>the linked list <strong>sorted</strong> as well</em>.</p> <p> </p> <p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p> <img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/problem_images/9e1bbdcfcdc628f2bb9f209917a2397dcc2a73067f0ee28446a0b396acf51558.jpg\" style=\"width: 302px; height: 242px;\"/> <pre><strong>Input:</strong> head = [1,1,2]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [1,2]\n</pre> <p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p> <img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/problem_images/c8f66b021ae8d221b629fcc33e0cac7c133718a9f29980692e73b5f6b8acdbe3.jpg\" style=\"width: 542px; height: 222px;\"/> <pre><strong>Input:</strong> head = [1,1,2,3,3]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [1,2,3]\n</pre> <p> </p> <p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p> <ul> <li>The number of nodes in the list is in the range <code>[0, 300]</code>.</li> <li><code>-100 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li> <li>The list is guaranteed to be <strong>sorted</strong> in ascending order.</li> </ul>",
  "hints": [],
